💬 Real-Time Chat Application
A full-featured real-time messaging platform with an admin dashboard, media sharing, and animated UI — built for production with Socket.IO and the MERN stack.
🔗 GitHub: https://github.com/AbuzarAli1122/Chat_App




✨ Features

⚡ Real-Time Messaging — Instant bi-directional communication powered by Socket.IO v4
🖼️ Media Uploads — Send images via Cloudinary integration
🏠 Room Management — UUID-based unique chat rooms
👑 Admin Dashboard — Monitor users, chats, and analytics
🎨 Smooth Animations — Framer Motion transitions throughout the UI
🔐 Secure Auth — JWT authentication with bcrypt password hashing
📱 Responsive Design — Works seamlessly on all screen sizes
🔍 SEO Optimized — React Helmet Async for meta management


